    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ wec gatdɛ ni Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh jak kä kuäär kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë tookɛ kuäär tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ diɔ̱k. Kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ päth diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär I-jëp ɛ woc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ ji̱ Juda jak kä thöpkɛ ki̱luni ti bathdɔɔri diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ kur ŋuaan cikä min bo̱r kɛ ki̱luni ti jiɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ ŋuaan dääpä ala tho̱lbo̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär I-jëp däman Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh ni Ɛl-ya-kim jak kä kuäär kä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cuɛ ciötdɛ ri̱t i̱ Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim. Kä cu Nɛko kuäär I-jëp Yɛ-ɣo-a-ɣadh naŋ kä I-jëp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë took Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim kuäär, tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run wäl kɛl. Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial min la Kuothdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar ben nyiëëny kɛ jɛ, kä cu Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar ɛ naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn a cɛ yian kɛ ciik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tha̱a̱ŋ kuakni luaak Kuɔth naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, cuɛ kɛ wä la̱th duëël kuäärädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua dueer kɛnɛ jiäk diaal tëë ca jek kä jɛ gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl kɛnɛ Juda. Kä cu gatdɛ ni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë took Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin kuäär tëë kɛ run wäl bädäk, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ päth diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ ni̱n wäl. Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ruel, cu kuäär ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar ɛ jäk kä ram wä jɛ nööŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛɛl kɛ kuak luaak Kuɔth tin gɔw, kä cu Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar däman ni Dhid-ki-yaa jak kä kuäär kä Juda kɛnɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruëc Dhid-ki-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë took Dhid-ki-yaa kuäär tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ kɛl, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run wäl kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial ni Kuothdɛ. Kä /kenɛ rɔ jak kä kɔ̱c nhiam go̱kä ni Yir-mɛ-yaa, mëë ruac kɛ thok Kuɔth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pɛ̈ɛ̈n Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuäär ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar ca̱p mi jiääk, mëë cu jɛ jak kä yaacɛ rɔ kɛ ciöt Kuɔth. Kä cu wi̱cdɛ buɔ̱m kɛ ɣöö derɛ luny kä Kuoth Nhial, Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu bööth palä diaal kɛ naath ce̱tkɛ jɛ kɛ thil ŋäthä, cua guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni jiäk döri diaal. Kä cua yia̱r ni luak Kuɔth Nhial, mëë cɛ lɛy kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial, Kuoth gua̱ni kɛ jäk kä ruac kɛ ja̱a̱k, kɛ ɣöö nhɔkɛ nɛɛkɛ kɛnɛ gua̱a̱th cieŋädɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ŋot yɔaŋkɛ ja̱a̱k Kuɔth, kä cua ruacdɛ dhɔt, kä dɔalkɛ göökɛ, cu mäni mëë cu kɛ̈cdɛ ben kä nɛɛkɛ, amäni mëë cuɛ thil ram mi cu kään. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth kɛ nöŋ kuäär Kɛ̈l-da-ya mëë cu ŋuɛ̈tnikiɛn näk amäni rɛy luaak Kuɔth, kä cuɛ thil mi cua ŋuɛ̈t kiɛ ram mi di̱i̱t kiɛ dɔaŋ päl. Cuɛ kɛn diaal la̱th tetdä kua̱r Kɛ̈l-da-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kuak luaak Kuɔth nikɛ yio̱wkɛ, kɛ yio̱w dhɔaar kua̱r kɛn ji̱ kɔaarɛ naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛnɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ luak Kuɔth waŋ, kä cua päny Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm däk. Kä cukɛ duel kua̱r waŋ, kä cua kuakɛ diaal tin gɔw yia̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ tëë ci kään naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c, kä cukɛ wa̱a̱ la̱a̱tkɛ, kɛnɛ gaatkɛ, cu mäni mëë ca kuäär Pa-rath yiath piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bi riet Kuɔth Nhial mëë cɛ lat kɛ thok Yir-mɛ-yaa a thuɔ̱k. Cu mun te lɔ̱ŋä kɛ gua̱a̱th ëë tëë baaŋ, amäni mëë ci run bärɔw thuɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lär Ko-rɛc kɛ luɔ̱ny pɛ̈ɛ̈cni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ ruɔ̱n ruëc Ko-rɛc kuäär Pa-rath in nhiam, kɛ ɣöö bi ruac Kuɔth Nhial mëë latdɛ kɛ thok Yir-mɛ-yaa a thuɔ̱k, cu Kuoth Nhial lɔc Ko-rɛc kuäär Pa-rath jak kä latdɛ ruac rɛy kuäärädɛ kɛɛliw, kä cuɛ jɛ gɔ̱r i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
